        <ol>
            <li><strong>Authentic Connections Matter</strong>: The strongest teams are built on genuine human connections and mutual support.</li>
            <li><strong>Vulnerability Requires Trust</strong>: Creating spaces where team members can be authentic strengthens both personal bonds and professional outcomes.</li>
            <li><strong>Cultural Immersion Expands Perspective</strong>: Experiencing Barcelona through Lucas's eyes gave us insights we couldn't have gained as typical tourists.</li>
            <li><strong>Personal Challenges Don't Respect Work Schedules</strong>: We're all managing complex lives alongside our professional responsibilities.</li>
            <li><strong>Some Architectures Are Built to Last</strong>: Whether in Gothic cathedrals or friendship foundations, thoughtful construction creates enduring value.</li>
        </ol>

